{"id":47,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> وَصَدُّو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> عَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن س</span>َبِيلِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ أَضَلَّ أَعْمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لَهُمْ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> وَعَمِلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>صَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِحَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِ وَءَامَنُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> بِمَا نُزِّلَ عَلَىٰ مُحَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">دٍ و</span>َهُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقُّ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ِن ر</span>َّبِّهِمْ‌ۙ كَفَّرَ عَنْهُمْ سَيِّـَٔـاتِهِمْ وَأَصْلَحَ بَالَهُمْ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ بِأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>تَّبَعُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْبَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>طِلَ وَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>تَّبَعُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقَّ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ِن ر</span>َّبِّهِمْ‌ۚ كَذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ يَضْرِبُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ لِل<span class=\"tj tj